# Keep the build context small and the restore layer cache-friendly.

# Version control / editor cruft
**/.git
**/.gitignore
**/.vs
**/.idea
**/.vscode
**/*.user
**/*.suo
**/*.swp

# .NET build output (restored/published inside the image instead)
**/bin
**/obj
**/out
**/TestResults

# Not needed to build the API image
tests/
docs/
.codegraph/
.omo/
.config/
*.md
*.sln
